# Grep-tool search exclusions (ripgrep reads this file; Glob does NOT — see
# AGENTS.md "搜索与工作树" for the scoped-search rule).
# These dirs are generated or vendored and are never a search target. Kept narrow:
# no worktree paths, so Grep scoped inside a worktree still works.
node_modules/
target/
dist/
dist-ssr/
coverage/
.git/
